{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21377","headline":"酬乐天待漏入合见赠 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天待漏入合见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未勘银台契，先排浴殿关。\n沃心因特召，[承]旨绝常班。\n颭闪才人袖，呕鵶软举鐶。\n宫花低作帐，云从积成山。\n密视枢机草，偷瞻咫尺颜。\n恩垂天语近，对久漏声闲。\n丹陛曾同立，金銮恨独攀。\n笔无鸿业润，袍愧紫文殷。\n河水通天上，瀛州接世间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}